#. module: om_ai_fields
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_ai_fields
msgid ""
"\n"
"AI fields for Odoo on the AI engine. An administrator picks a field of any model, or creates one, and writes a\n"
"prompt with record values such as {{ partner_id.name }}. The AI fills the field on demand from the Actions menu,\n"
"in the background when chosen fields change, or on a schedule for empty values. Selection and many2one fields only\n"
"take valid values. A server action type \"Update Fields with AI\" fills several fields at once in automation rules.\n"
msgstr ""

